## Key Gotcha with ExternalTaskSensor — execution_delta

The most common source of bugs. Both DAGs must align on `execution_date`:

```yaml
# Payments DAG runs at 06:00 → execution_date = 2024-06-01 06:00
# Customer DAG runs at 08:00 → execution_date = 2024-06-01 08:00
# They have DIFFERENT execution_dates for the same logical day

# Fix — tell the sensor to look 2 hours back
wait_for_payments_dag:
  operator: airflow.sensors.external_task.ExternalTaskSensor
  external_dag_id: "cash_management__payments__ingestion__daily"
  external_task_id: ~
  execution_delta:
    hours: 2                 # customer runs 2 hours after payments
                             # so look 2 hours back for the matching payments run
```

