## Recommended Guardrails for Cross-DAG Dependencies

Document these rules in your team onboarding:

| Rule | Why |
|---|---|
| Cross-team dependencies need both team leads to approve the PR | Prevents surprise breakages |
| Always set `timeout` on ExternalTaskSensor | Prevents sensors hanging forever |
| Always set `failed_states` on ExternalTaskSensor | Fails fast instead of waiting until timeout |
| Use `mode: reschedule` not `mode: poke` | Releases worker slots between checks |
| Maintain a central dependency map doc | So schedule changes don't blindside downstream teams |
| Prefer Datasets over ExternalTaskSensor for new pipelines | More resilient to schedule changes |
